      "id": "claim_90b7660e1b9d4ba89130fb61548a2636",
      "statement": "The authentication workflow is split across an HTTP client, a pure response transformer, a Pinia user store, and a UI composable: AuthApiClient performs raw authentication requests, AuthTransformer validates and shapes API data, useUserStore owns token/profile state and persistence, and useAuth exposes loading, errors, captcha, and auth actions to pages.",
